Yeh lijiye sabhi important documentation files ke exact filenames aur unka mukhtasir maqsad:

* **`PRD.md`** – Product Requirements Document (Project ka vision, goals, aur features)
* **`TRD.md`** – Technical Requirements Document (Tech stack aur technical constraints)
* **`SYSTEM-ARCHITECTURE.md`** – System Architecture (Modules aur data flow diagrams)
* **`DATABASE-SCHEMA.md`** – Database Schema & ERD (Tables, relations, aur columns)
* **`API-DOCS.md`** – API Specification (Endpoints, request/response payloads)
* **`ADR.md`** – Architectural Decision Records (Important technical decisions ki history)
* **`RULES.md` (ya `.cursorrules`)** – AI & Coding Standards (AI assistants ke liye rules)
* **`TASKS-CHECKLIST.md`** – Project Roadmap & Tasks (Sprint aur todo check list)
* **`README.md`** – Main Repository Entry (Setup, installation, aur project introduction)
* **`CONTRIBUTING.md`** – Contribution Guidelines (Branching aur PR rules)
* **`CHANGELOG.md`** – Version History (Updates aur releases ka record)